  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the Model Context Protocol base protocol and server and client features at revision 2026-07-28: JSON-RPC messages, error codes and per-request _meta, stateless versioning with server/discover, stdio and Streamable HTTP with standard and x-mcp-header headers, multi round-trip requests, subscriptions, cancellation and progress, tools, resources, prompts, completion, pagination, caching hints, deprecated logging, sampling and roots, elicitation, and the security best practices, plus the Tasks and Skills extensions and the MCP Registry server.json format. Version lines: 2026-07-28 is current, 2025-11-25 and 2025-06-18 are supported, 2025-03-26 and 2024-11-05 are legacy, and the draft is tracked as a preview; the Tasks extension 2026-07-28, the Skills extension (stable) and server.json 2025-12-11 are separate families. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines and upgrades, lifecycle and transports, server features, client features, extensions and the registry, and security.",
